<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
  <Document>
    <name>Planning Map 2025 Spring ConFest</name>
    <description><![CDATA[This is the View Only copy of the Live Map prior to Spring 2025 event :-D<br>www.confest.org.au/map - Anyone can add to this crowdsourced ConFest Live Map. How-to edit: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1xvPF9ig_dGeAMnI26uI3uVWLHhbQGFIK5iIeULIF4o4/edit?usp=sharing<br><br>Data from this live map will be used to plan the next ConFest Spring 2025 event. Thanks for your input, please feel free to add anything to the map.<br><br>Collaborative Mapping process facilitated by Dane Murray, ConFest Mapping Facilitator, Spring ConFest 2025. Email: confest.maps@gmail.com or dane@spaceman.events 👨🏼‍🚀]]></description>
